{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHOING SILENCE</strong><br><i>A tense, atmospheric survival experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an isolated cave system in first-person, where you'll manage your supplies, document what you find, and fight to stay sane as the silence and darkness slowly close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map. No help. Just you\u2026 the echo\u2026 and a forgotten story waiting to be uncovered \u2014 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment demands caution \u2014 true cave exploration is slow, careful, and deliberate. The constant disorientation turns the simple act of navigation into a true test of survival and mental resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unstable, treacherous terrain makes every step a tense, deliberate choice \u2014 where a single mistake could mean the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.poster.avif?t=1757339462\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.webm?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.mp4?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the silence and the darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast underground maze, where silence and darkness are your only companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets buried here were never meant to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path will define your fate \u2014 a great discovery\u2026 or being lost forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.poster.avif?t=1757339462\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.webm?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.mp4?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the isolation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion are always against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind may hold\u2026 or it may break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real danger might not lie ahead \u2014 but all around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.poster.avif?t=1757339462\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.webm?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.mp4?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light is your ally\u2026 but for how long?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flashlights, lanterns, and glowsticks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every shadow is empty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the light goes out, only your footsteps will remain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Echoing Silence</strong> to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to face the darkness\u2026 and the silence?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrival at the Island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/8704dcefbf8f2b4153cc070af4669f1f985d10fc.jpg"},{"name":"Who brought all this stuff?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/c9b176110348f54071eff121596209253b581094.jpg"},{"name":"What was I thinking?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/03daf81668767dcd2aebefe7a7d2045c77816960.jpg"},{"name":"I just hope I don\u2019t fall!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/05193a8bf0fdf8625520a2d30c1bc94513e5c9d4.jpg"},{"name":"Base Camp Established","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/c487388c37fc23928ad8efc3e732ceb9cf2c6a7d.jpg"},{"name":"First Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/25fb74c1e36220eb52c1413ced83702620e28ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Second Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/a6a003dbb3b2f55bbeee86171ac4278f8a6be060.jpg"},{"name":"Third Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/a29624a55cb3bea4b4f2d4c19decff3d75e9673e.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/d5c65fc8da2e886ebf8e3024804cd4cb091bf5bd.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151230/e1c8667b3e3129addc1559bf50408046500b7368.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3151230?t=1757339462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/be427ba25e5e578d27ecfad19b3f9485aedfed90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757339462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/f6d205b8c3d04ddc77fccccc0b3b66672dd5a499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757339462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/f6d205b8c3d04ddc77fccccc0b3b66672dd5a499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757339462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work: Includes frequent violence, mature themes, and disturbing elements."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHOING SILENCE</strong><br><i>A tense, atmospheric survival experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an isolated cave system in first-person, where you'll manage your supplies, document what you find, and fight to stay sane as the silence and darkness slowly close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map. No help. Just you\u2026 the echo\u2026 and a forgotten story waiting to be uncovered \u2014 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment demands caution \u2014 true cave exploration is slow, careful, and deliberate. The constant disorientation turns the simple act of navigation into a true test of survival and mental resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unstable, treacherous terrain makes every step a tense, deliberate choice \u2014 where a single mistake could mean the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.poster.avif?t=1757339462\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.webm?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.mp4?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the silence and the darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast underground maze, where silence and darkness are your only companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets buried here were never meant to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path will define your fate \u2014 a great discovery\u2026 or being lost forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.poster.avif?t=1757339462\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.webm?t=1757339462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.mp4